 "_note_iq1": "IQ-1 SW-1 (September 12, 2026), REPAIRED by IQ1-2 (September 13, 2026). The commanded arm with a France that SPENDS. ⚠ AS FIRST WRITTEN THIS ARM COULD NOT MEASURE ABSORPTION: each of the 13 buy orders REPLACED the `recruit` line the substitute market competes with, so the arm differed from commanded_full40 by two changes at once and ended on 24 provinces against the baseline's 29 — which is how 'absorbs 29,564 gold, a THIRD of the surplus' was published when the real purchase component is 18,537. The buy is now an ADDITIONAL order on the same turn (recruit + buy = 2 admin actions, exactly `max_admin_actions`), so this arm differs from commanded_full40 BY THE PURCHASE AND NOTHING ELSE and `commanded_full40` is its lever-off control on the same seed. Pair with --diplomacy accept, as its parent does. The order names 30,000 men, which is LEVY_MAX_BATCH batches — the purchase a player holding 88,556 gold would make."
